.page-header
  .container
    .eyebrow // documentation
    %h1 The manuals.
    %p
      Reference documentation for BDD::Behave and the modules built around it.

.container
  %ul.doc-set-grid
    %li.doc-set
      %h2
        %a{href: '/docs/BDD-Behave'} BDD::Behave
      %p
        The testing framework itself: spec structure, let and hooks, the matcher
        library, doubles and stubbing, parallel execution, coverage, and the
        command-line runner.
      %p.doc-set-meta 36 pages
    %li.doc-set
      %h2
        %a{href: '/docs/BDD-Behave-Playwright'} BDD::Behave::Playwright
      %p
        Browser testing on top of Behave: driving a real browser from a spec,
        the page matchers, system tests, and the screenshot and console output
        captured when one fails.
      %p.doc-set-meta 7 pages
    %li.doc-set
      %h2
        %a{href: '/docs/WWW-Playwright'} WWW::Playwright
      %p
        The Raku binding to Playwright underneath it all: launching browsers,
        actions and queries, the Browser, Context, Page and Locator API, and
        the wire protocol it speaks.
      %p.doc-set-meta 13 pages
    %li.doc-set
      %h2
        %a{href: '/docs/ORM-Factory'} ORM::Factory
      %p
        Test data without the boilerplate: the factory DSL, sequences and
        transient attributes, inheritance and variants, associations and
        callbacks, and the ORM::ActiveRecord adapter.
      %p.doc-set-meta 28 pages
